  TWO-YEAR ANNIVERSARY!\n\nTo celebrate the show's birthday (and kick off Bu
 rlington Pride Week)\, come join host\, comedian and producer Tal Friedman 
  (and late night DJ Goblynn)\, for this celebration of all things queer\,
  goofy and hot!\n\nBe there or be square!!\n\nAGES : ALL (18+ recommended)\
 nDOORS: 6:30pm for 7pm shows\n(Come early and have a drink in the lounge!)\
